WEBVTT

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.936
Lily Tomlin: Hand me one of those waters,

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.176
I'm extremely dry.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.040
(Laughter)

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.720
JF: You're taking up our time.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:44.936
We have a very limited --

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.296
LT: Just being with her
sucks the life out of me.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.096
(Laughter)

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.856
JF: You ain't seen nothing yet.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.096
Anyway -- sorry.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:57.496
PM: So tell me, what do you
look for in a friend?

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.096
LT: I look for someone
who has a sense of fun,